    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "`startioProd` is the production environment module for the `startio` application."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Use this module for production composition and production-scoped configuration. Server-specific runtime settings belong in child server modules."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Production configuration must preserve governance, security, audit, diagnostics, and explicit override boundaries."
